      "id": "boot-to-mount-text-87",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1146,
      "y": 662,
      "width": 229.87499999999991,
      "height": 125,
      "text": "“operations could not be loaded”,\nthe message the error carries, its\ncode, and a Retry button that makes\na genuinely fresh attempt.\n\nThe chrome stays. Every other App\nstays reachable. One boundary is\nthe whole cost of the failure.",
      "originalText": "“operations could not be loaded”,\nthe message the error carries, its\ncode, and a Retry button that makes\na genuinely fresh attempt.\n\nThe chrome stays. Every other App\nstays reachable. One boundary is\nthe whole cost of the failure.",
